window.products.push({"id":1106011,"name":"10lb co2 New Aluminum Cylinder with Siphon Tube CGA320 Valve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615g5ul6ikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New 10 pound aluminum CO2 cylinder with standard CGA320 valve and siphon tube. Includes a custom-fit copper siphon tube used to transfer liquid CO2 for refilling smaller co2 tanks. We do not sell the additional external items necessary to refill smaller tanks. 7″ diameter x 21″ height (with valve and handle). DOT- and TC-approved. Certified or hydro-tested within 18 months of shipment. The natrual corrosion-resistance of aluminum is especially important for gases like carbon dioxide and is far lighter than steel cylinders of the same capacity and size. These are great for low-temp performance applications like beverage, aquatic, industrial, etc. All cylinders ship empty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615g5ul6ikL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTC Valve Sales","source_asin":"B00A7X4S44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A7X4S44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A7X4S44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
