window.products.push({"id":1106354,"name":"36 x 24 LED Backlit Mirror, HWH Bathroom Lighted Vanity Mirror, Smart Mirror Anti-Fog, Dimmable Makeup Mirror for Wall(Horizontal/Vertical), 5HA26-BM","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nyv6T0rzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"⭐【Vertical & Horizontal】A square bathroom vanity mirror can be installed vertical and horizontal, with a diameter of 36 x 24'', 120V voltage and 46W power, 50,000 hours life-long LED light source with 3000K warm light. Hardwire installation and all mounting hardware included. ⭐【Dimmable & Memorize LED Light】An ideal LED lighted backlit mirror for bathroom upgrades from HWH. Long press the round touch button to step-less dimming from 15%-100%. It has a memory function, the mirror will maintain the brightness you prefer to next time when you turn on the mirror. ⭐【Auto Defog & High CRI 95+】This smart mirror will automatically defog when it is turned on, so you won't be bothered by water steam and clean manually, anti-fog function and 95+ high CRI help to keep always a clear reflection image! Suitable for both home and hotel bathrooms, and other public and business places. ⭐【High Quality & Explosion-Proof】This IP44 rated backlit bathroom mirror has a white metal protection frame to wrap around the edge of the glass, and the back is closed with high-quality aluminum alloy to protect parts and wires from damp. Explosion-proof glass protects your family's safety in the event of an accident. ⭐【Solid & Professional Package】The thickened carton, honeycomb panel, and foam cushion. Solid packaging has passed professional drop test, crash test, and simulated road transportion test. The upgraded packaging in order to deliver the complete and undamaged product to our customers! ⭐【Certificated & Free Worry Purchase】ETL Listed LED bathroom wall-mounted mirror, just rest assure to use. HWH Lighting striving for customer satisfaction. So if you have any questions or suggestions with order and product, please feel free to contact us, we provide products with a two-year warranty period and provide you with an indefinite period of customer service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nyv6T0rzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HWH INVESTMENT","source_asin":"B08ZCCXJ2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZCCXJ2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZCCXJ2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
