window.products.push({"id":1106416,"name":"RYAHEU Rectangle Placemats Set of 4 for Dining Table Settings, Heat Insulation Non-Slip Placemats for Kitchen Table Protector，Washable Vinyl Woven Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YhVRXaQkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY: Our placemats are made of 70%VPC + 30% polyester. The thick and durable table mats are treated with sealing technique to eliminate rough edges, protecting your hands as well as your dinner table. EASY CARE: The plastic placemats are waterproof and easy to clean. When liquids spill on it, just wipe it clean with a soft cloth. Use sponge to scrub stains with proper amount of detergent and water. After washing, let it dry in a cool place and it will be good as new (DO NOT machine wash or microwave it for disinfection) HEAT RESISTENT MAT: The vinyl placemats feature heat insulation, flame resistance, acid & alkali resistance, anti-abrasion and good elasticity. Please make sure the utensil put on the placemat is ≤212℉(100℃). It will well protect your tabletop of wood, glass or other materials. ANTI-SLIPPERY: Ideal for daily use, the washable placemats have anti-slippery design at the back, with elegant and stylish pattern at the front. They go well with dark-color wooden table, glass table, farmhouse dining table, white and brown kitchen table. The placemats set of 4 are suitable for barbecue and outdoor dining table, perfect to be used as outdoor placemats for patio table, Christmas table mats, Thanksgiving table decor and dinning table decor. ANTI-WRINKLE: The table mats set of 4 contains four pieces of 18\"X12\" (45cmX35cm) mats. If you receive the place mats folded, put them in warm water and then lay heavy items on them to make flat. Please contact us in 24 hours if you have any problems or questions. We will solve it for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YhVRXaQkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RYAHEU","source_asin":"B097YVCCHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097YVCCHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097YVCCHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
