window.products.push({"id":1106527,"name":"Prep Solutions by Progressive Flexible Measuring Spoons - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618b7w8xEHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Annoyed by sticky ingredients that are difficult to measure and even harder to remove? Try our Prep Solutions by Progressive Flexible Measuring Spoon Set. These spoons have a durable plastic frame for stability and a flexible base to easily pop out ingredients. The 4 piece set includes: 1/4 tsp, 1/2 tsp, 1 tsp and 1Tbsp measuring spoons with easy to read, standard and metric measurements. They also have a removable storage ring which can keep the spoons together for your convenience. These measuring spoons are dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618b7w8xEHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B0784RF4F8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0784RF4F8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0784RF4F8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1106528,"name":"16 Pack Red White and Blue Patriotic Decorations 4th of July Decorations, Patriotic Hanging Paper Fans American Flag Pennant Banner USA Swallowtail Fl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ZSoRySBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUANTITY: This red, white and blue patriotic decorations set includes: 6 pcs patriotic hanging party paper fans in red, white & blue, 6 pcs tissue paper flower balls in red, white & navy blue, 6.6' long USA swallowtail flag banner, 2 strands of 6.6' long hanging star paper garland star streamers (with 18 pcs stars per string) in red, white & blue and 12.5' long American flags pennant banner string (with 10 USA flags). GREAT PATRIOTIC DECORATIONS: This set of patriotic party supplies is perfect for 4th of July, Independence Day, Memorial Day picnic and American theme party. Also great for Veterans Day, Labor Day party, Flag Day, Military Homecoming, a political rally, firework party or any other patriotic theme celebration to show your American pride and patriotic spirit. DIMENSIONS: The star party swirls measure appr. 25\"-30\" hanging in length. The patriotic paper fans are available in 3 sizes, 8\", 12\" and 16\" in diameter. Tissue paper flower balls come in 2 sizes with diameters of 8 \"and 10\". The USA swallowtail flag banner measures appr. 6.6' long (each flag is appr. 5.1\" x 6.7\"). The length of star streamer is about 6.6'(each star is appr. 2.2 \" x 2.2 \"). The American flags pennant banner string measures appr. 12.5' long (each USA flag is appr. 5.5\" x 8.3\"). MATERIAL: The patriotic paper fans are made of heavy paper and clearly printed with bright, beautiful patterns on both sides, easy to hold open with the included clips. The USA swallowtail flag banner is made of high-quality linen. The star garland streamer made of high-quality cards. The USA flags pennant banner are made of durable polyester fabric, printed with the American flag on each side. Tissue paper flower balls are made from high-quality paper, which is perfect for your patriotic party. WIDE APPLICATION: With this set of red, white and blue decorations, you can easily create impressive festive patriotic decorations whether you are in your home, office, restaurant, mall or classroom decoration. Simply hang the star party swirls, USA swallowtail flag banner, star paper garland, American flag pennant banner, the red white and blue patriotic paper fans, the red white and blue tissue paper flower balls decorations and enjoy your patriotic party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ZSoRySBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D-BUY","source_asin":"B085WRBC1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085WRBC1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085WRBC1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
