window.products.push({"id":1106581,"name":"Concepts In Wood Midas Four Shelf Bookcase 48\" H Medium Oak Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":192.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y5NbMsTES._AC_.jpg","description":"The Concepts in Wood 4 shelf single wide Bookcase has a beautiful 10 step finish on wood veneer that really sets this bookshelf apart from the rest and utilizes an environmentally friendly zero VOC emissions finish process. This is a piece of furniture using solid wood trim pieces and wood veneer panels versus all the paper laminate varieties out there. Very durable with 70lb. weight capacity per shelf. 3 adjustable shelves allow you to customize the storage space to accommodate a variety of book sizes and 1 fixed shelf provides structural reinforcement. A dowel and cam lock assembly design ensures a strong durable bookcase. Wood elements are sourced in the USA and assembled in Mexico. This versatile storage bookcase is ideal for home or office use, laundry, bedroom, kitchen, garage or any other room. Ready for assembly.Features :- Materials: Genuine wood veneers and solid wood molding- 10 step polyurethane oak finish- 3 adjustable shelves and 1 fixed shelf to accommodate large and small items- Quick, simple assembly with dowels, camlocks and an engineered wood back panel that is more durable than the cardboard on most ready to assemble bookcases- Materials are imported from the U.S. and manufactured in Mexico- Create a wall of bookcases, designed to be stacked next to each other as your storage needs grow.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 48\"H x 30.5\"W x 10.63\"D- Product Weight : 67 lbs- Shelf Weight Capacity : 70 lbs per shelf for superior durability- Number of Shelves : 3 (Adjustable), 1 (Fixed)- Warranty : 2 years- Assembly Required : Yes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41y5NbMsTES._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Concepts In Wood","source_asin":"B081B7738H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081B7738H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081B7738H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1106582,"name":"Bion, Large Evil Eye Wall Hanging, Turkish Evil Eye, Greek Evil Eye - Big Evil Eye Wall Decor, Turkish Evil Eye, Greek Evil Eye, Nazar, Evil Eye Bead ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dndD6-nTL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Chances are you have seen this famous symbol many times. You’ve probably even worn one and you’ve definitely seen someone wearing an evil eye amulet. You may have witnessed a person give the “evil eye” look (and you may have even given it yourself). But do you know the deep and meaningful history of the evil eye symbol, and do you know how popular and prevalent the evil eye is throughout a plethora of different cultures? Below is the need-to-know information on the symbol that is so popular. Turkish evil eye , \"Nazar Boncugu\" in Turkish language. Mostly beleived in Turkey, Greece and Israel; evil eye figure gives people good luck and protects from jealous looks :) This big size evil eye wall hanging give your home positive energy. Evil eye wall decor will add color to your home with its special design. Evil eye home decor will be one of the most rare decorations in your home with rustic, oriental style. As you look at the bazaar you will feel away from the stress of the day. In different languages, the evil eye is known as: Hebrew Evil Eye – Ayin Ha’ra Turkish Evil Eye – Nazar Boncugu Italian Evil Eye – Mal Occhio Farsi – Bla Band Arabic – Ayin Harsha Scotland – Droch Shuil Spanish – Mal Ojo or El Oja France – Mauvais Oeil Germany – Böser Blick Romans – Oculus Malus The Eye of Providence (or the all-seeing eye of God) is a symbol, having its origin in Christian iconography, showing an eye often surrounded by rays of light or a glory and usually enclosed by a triangle. It represents the eye of God watching over humanity (the concept of divine providence).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dndD6-nTL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BION","source_asin":"B07MBZPHRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MBZPHRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MBZPHRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1106583,"name":"Cardboard Safari Recycled Cardboard Animal Taxidermy Moose Trophy Head, Modern Art Prints, Drip Fred Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919ZWpbnCZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Splatter painting originated from the Abstract Expressionist Movement that began in New York in the 1940's after World War II.  The Abstract Expressionist Movement was begun, in a sense, as a response to art censorship in the United States of America. Some of the art was used to express political opinions without it being considered biased toward any belief because of the abstract aspect. Cardboard Safari: Based in the Blue Ridge mountains in Charlottesville, Virginia; inspired by the landscape that surrounds them. They celebrate the union of art and technology, joining imagination and fabrication to make beautiful sculptural forms for your home. Their goal is to make unique art; fun products that foster an appreciation for the natural world. Creativity, conservation, and collaboration are paramount to their mission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919ZWpbnCZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cardboard Safari","source_asin":"B075F9WK22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075F9WK22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075F9WK22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
