window.products.push({"id":1106599,"name":"AVAWING Leather Massage Recliner Chair with Heated, 360 Degree Swivel Ergonomic Recliner Lounge Sofa Chair w/Cup Holder, Side Pockets for Living Room,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYKofT1sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💺【360° SWIVEL & RECLINING】 With a 360° swivel function, you can easily move the recliner in any direction 360° while sitting, which saves you from having to twist your chair or reposition it while standing. And you can adjust the inclination angle by 120-160 ° and raise the leg rest through the pull ring on the side, it will provide you with the ultimate leisure experience. 💺【MASSAGE & HEATING】 This massage chair has 8 vibration massage points, 5 control modes, and 2 intensity options. You can enjoy a full-body massage at home. The massage can relieve pressure on the waist, promote blood circulation, and eliminate stress and fatigue. In addition, there is a 15/30/60 minute timer function, which is convenient for you to set the massage time. 💺【HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS】 AVAWING swivel recliner is made of soft fabrics, thick cushions and high-density sponges, with the line design of the process and large seats. It is supportive but very comfortable to sit down, bringing you an amazing sense of comfort. The metal frame is made of sturdy material, which can support the weight well and is durable, which is very suitable for home use. 💺【HUMANIZED DESIGN】 Equipped with 2 cup holders, which can hold drinks or mobile phones to free your hands. When you lie on it, there are 2 side pockets for you to store the remote or magazines. If you accidentally spill a drink on the rotating recliner, just wipe off the stain with a wet towel to avoid the trouble of cleaning. 💺【EASY TO ASSEMBLE & SERVICE】 All parts are included and can be easily assembled according to the instructions. If you have any questions, you can contact us at any time, and we will provide professional customer service within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYKofT1sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVAWING","source_asin":"B09LQV6WN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQV6WN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQV6WN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1106600,"name":"imarku Stainless Steel Frying Pan - 3 Ply Steel Skillet - Professional Grade Pans for Cooking - 12 Inch Cooking Surface stainless steel pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PTubStEDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE COOKING PAN - imarku cookware combines elegant design with superior functionality for optimal cooking. 12 inch frying pan is designed for multiple cooking purposes, with a flat bottom and sloped sides making it easy to turn and roll for even cooking of food, perfect for stir-frying, sautéing and more. Ideal for daily use by chefs or families. STURDY AND DURABLE - The frying pan features a premium 3-ply stainless steel base and thick aluminum core that absorbs heat quickly, resists rust and warping, and maximum durability. The skillet base eliminates hot spots and distributes heat evenly throughout the stainless steel pan, cooking food faster and saving you time. HEALTHY COOKING - The surface of the sauté pan is made of 304 stainless steel (18% chromium, 8% nickel) without chemical coating, healthier and more durable than non-stick pans. The stainless steel skillet gives you unexpected cooking results with the easiest cooking method. Compatible with all stovetops, you can easily move from stovetop to oven. STAY-COOL HANDLE - Our fry pan is equipped with ergonomic handle that minimizes heat buildup, the double-riveted construction provides a comfortable, secure grip, and the handle is curved just right to move easily from the stovetop to the oven. In addition, The hanging hole on the handle is designed for easy hanging storage and saving space. PREMIUM PRODUCTS AND SERVICE - imarku focus on developing high quality cookware, is a trustworthy kitchenware brand, we provide a 1-year warranty for this stainless steel cookware for free, if you have any problem in the future please contact us in time, we will give you the most satisfactory after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PTubStEDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"imarku","source_asin":"B09Q675GVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q675GVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q675GVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
