window.products.push({"id":1106764,"name":"2 Liter Oak Aging Barrel with Stand, Bung and Spigot - Wooden Whiskey Barrel Wine Barrel - for The Home Brewer, Distiller, Wine Maker and Cocktail Agi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613qADOPkLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW DOES IT WORK? Cure your oak aging barrel following the instructions included, then simply pour in your favorite spirit and Age to Taste! Aging Whiskey in a wood barrel cask made from new American Oak. Charred mini barrels are perfect for whisky PERFECT BARREL AGED COCKTAILS - Extract natural flavors from the charred oak BARREL interior (vanilla and sweet spices) and infuse them into any classic cocktail: the Manhattan, Martini, Negroni, Old Fashioned, Sazerac, Mint Julep, Whiskey Sour MULTIPLE APPLICATIONS - Use as a dispenser for wine, cider, beer, hot sauce or kombucha. Our wooden barrel / whisky barrel can be re-used for many years and fits any kitchen countertop, man cave or liquor cabinet. Wine casks barrel for liquor Our new oak barrels are made from American Oak and personalized versions are available. Great for whisky or Kentucky bourbon. New oak barrels turn white whiskey to aged whisky in weeks. Our wood staves are aged and charred for maximum flavor. INCLUDES - One 2 liter American oak bourbon barrel with wooden stand, oak bung and spigot, funnels, storing tablets and complete instructions. For dimensions, see graphic size chart for new oak barrels. Alcohol NOT included!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613qADOPkLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THOUSAND OAKS BARREL","source_asin":"B0B9LDJ4V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9LDJ4V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9LDJ4V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
