window.products.push({"id":1106859,"name":"PAMI Double Zip Freezer Quart Bags [75 Pieces] - Leakproof Food Storage Freshness-Lock Bags With Expandable Bottom- Food-Safe Zipper Bags With Freezer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OYKh98tkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LEAKPROOF DOUBLE ZIP FREEZER BAGS WITH WRITE-ON LABEL: Store any dry or wet ingredients neatly in your freezer, refrigerator or pantry with these super versatile freezer food bags that feature a strong double zipper closure for hassle-free use. They even have a designated write-on label to note everything you need to remember. No more complicated knots, messy leaks, or misplaced food bags! FREEZER SHIELD TECHNOLOGY: PROLONGED FRESHNESS. ZERO FREEZER BURNS: Nasty freezer burns happen when your frozen foods are exposed to cold and dry air, causing them to lose moisture. Our airtight food storage zip bags keep the contents of the bag fully protected from outside air to prevent those annoying freezer burns from ruining your meats, fish, veggies and other goodies. EXPANDABLE BOTTOM FOR EXTRA ROOM & EASY FILLING: The expandable bottom of our food storage bags gives you plenty of space to easily store an endless number of different ingredients. Plus, their wide base allows them to stand up on their own for mess-free filling. Once the bag is filled, you can easily lay it flat for stackable, space-saving storage in any type of freezer. AVAILABLE IN 2 SIZES [QUART & GALLON] – GREAT FOR MANY KITCHEN USES: Thick and durable enough to be reused time after time, our Freshness-Lock bags are perfect for: meal prep and homemade frozen meals, organizing ingredients and leftovers, portioning and freezing meats and fish without any freezer burns, packing snacks, keeping refrigerated goods fresh for longer or even for organizing any small items around your home! BACKED UP BY PAMI’S SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Focused on creating the highest quality disposable dinnerware and kitchen organization supplies, each PAMI product is backed up by an Unconditional 30-Day Money-Back Satisfaction Guarantee. With nothing to worry about, you can order yours today completely risk-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OYKh98tkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAMI","source_asin":"B0BSLNWG69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSLNWG69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSLNWG69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1106860,"name":"Feng Shui Resin Money Frog (Three Legged Toad/Wealth Frog) Figure on Base Decoration(Gold, S)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aMetuP+cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lore of the Money Frog The money frog also called the three-legged toad or money toad comes from Chinese folklore. According to the legend, a wife of one of the eight immortals stole the elixir of immortality and drank it, turning her into a toad. Instead of two hind legs, the toad has the tail of the tadpole. Frogs and toads are associated with water, which is symbolic of wealth. It is common for a money frog to have a coin in its mouth, as an offering for the owner or the household where the frog resides. Placing a Money Frog Traditionally, the money frog is placed in a home's feng shui money area or wealth position. This is usually the corner of the home that is diagonally opposite the entry door and is known as the primary wealth position. The corner opposite (straight across from) the primary wealth position is the secondary wealth position. In addition to placing a money frog in the money area, you can also place a second money frog close to the front door. In this case, it's important to position the frog so that it looks inside the house rather than facing out through the entrance. You can also place a money frog so that it faces your Money and Success feng shui direction. Where Not to Place a Money Frog Always position your feng shui money frog in a respectful way, so it is best not to place your money frog directly on the floor, but rather on a raised surface, such as a cabinet. The cabinet (or other surface) should be placed against a wall for backing support. It should not be in the middle of a room, under a window, or in a hallway or traffic area. Also, it is best not to place a feng shui money frog in your bedroom or in your bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aMetuP+cL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feng Shui","source_asin":"B07HNJDY4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNJDY4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNJDY4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
