window.products.push({"id":1106927,"name":"Neck Pillow for Airplane Travel, Adjustable Travel Neck Pillow with Detachable Hood, Washable Inflatable Travel Pillow with Cell Phone Pocket, Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1vmT3z+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Too soft or too hard. Find the perfect firmness by adding air a breath at a time or removing incrementally with the touch of a button. Avoid head leaning to the side. Swivel the pillow freely around your neck to find the perfect spot. If you are an avid traveler, then you will know just how uncomfortable long haul flights can be. Fortunately, there are plenty of products that can make your journey far more comfortable and convenient. One of these is an inflatable travel pillow. Why choose our H shaped pillow: 1.This travel pillow that keeps your head in a comfortable position and flanks on both sides to prevent your head and neck from tilting too much. 2.This airplane travel pillow adopts an exquisite composite rubber sealing technology, which makes the joints more tightly sealed. 3.Only takes you 3 seconds to blow this travel neck pillow to full by mouth. It's most comfortable for sleep if this airplane neck pillow is blow up to 80-90 percent. 4.This travel rest neck pillow comes with an adjustable lace that you can adjust the tightness in a comfortable position. 5.Our neck pillow can be deflated and folded as hand size, so it can fit into your backpack and suitcase. Different ways to use: 1. Give support to your head 2. Give your chin support and stretch your neck comfortably 3. Support your neck and head when leaning for rest 4. Support your shoulder for good posture Product Specification: Color: Black Cover material: Velvet and PVC material Shape: H shape Size: 12.5x13.7inch Guarantee: Our airplane travel pillows are backed with money-back guarantee. If there is any dissatisfaction, we will refund your money, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1vmT3z+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gerald small","source_asin":"B07X2KPQ25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1106927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X2KPQ25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X2KPQ25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
